From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 08:14:22 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Log the group relay subscriptions sent and the STUN types the
 relay answers

A joiner whose relay answered every allocate yet forwarded no media either
way left no trace of what it asked for: the PIDs it subscribed to, its own
PID and the token are now logged when a group allocate is sent, and the
relay traffic summary names the STUN message types that came back, so an
allocate error is told apart from allocate-success and pong.
